  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Aquatic Resources West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aquatic and Environmental Health in West Africa: capacity development related to fish health and environmental health, with an aim to strengthen the quality and relevance of education in fish health and environmental health and establish research programmes in partner institutions. Recruitment of female students(at least 50%) is a priority.</narrative>
